{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42508","headline":"寄禅月大师 · 周庠","name":"寄禅月大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日尘游到几家，就中偏省近宣麻。\n水田铺座时移画，金地谭空说尽沙。\n傍竹欲添犀浦石，栽松更碾味江茶。\n有时捻得休公卷，倚柱闲吟见落霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}